{{trans-mid}}
{{trans-bottom}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|ruffl|ing}}

# {{transitive}} To make a [[ruffle]] in; to curl or [[flute]], ''as'' an edge of fabric.
#: ''Ruffle the end of the cuff.''
# {{transitive}} To [[disturb]] ; especially, to cause to [[flutter]].
#: ''The wind '''ruffled''' the papers.''

